===Etymology===
From {{affix|en|tetracyclic|-ine}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌtɛ.tɹəˈsaɪ.kliːn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}} {{abbreviated|en|tet}}

# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug|uncountable}} A yellow [[crystalline]] [[broad-spectrum]] [[antibiotic]] C<sub>22</sub>H<sub>24</sub>N<sub>2</sub>O<sub>8</sub> produced by [[streptomyces]] or [[synthetically]].
# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug|countable}} Any of a large group of [[antibiotic]]s with the same general [[structure]] derived from [[tetracene]] with many [[hydroxyl]] and other groups.

